{"suttaId":"snp4.15","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Sn","vriCode":"s0505m.mul","paras":[3205,3266],"vripara":"941"},"segments":{"snp4.15:0.2":"Attadaṇḍasuttaṃ","snp4.15:1.1":"“Attadaṇḍā bhayaṃ jātaṃ,","snp4.15:1.2":"janaṃ passatha medhagaṃ;","snp4.15:1.3":"Saṃvegaṃ kittayissāmi,","snp4.15:1.4":"yathā saṃvijitaṃ mayā. 942.","snp4.15:2.1":"“Phandamānaṃ pajaṃ disvā,","snp4.15:2.2":"macche appodake yathā;","snp4.15:2.3":"Aññamaññehi byāruddhe,","snp4.15:2.4":"disvā maṃ bhayamāvisi. 943.","snp4.15:3.1":"“Samantamasāro loko,","snp4.15:3.2":"disā sabbā sameritā;","snp4.15:3.3":"Icchaṃ bhavanamattano,","snp4.15:3.4":"nāddasāsiṃ anositaṃ. 944.","snp4.15:4.1":"“Osānetveva byāruddhe,","snp4.15:4.2":"disvā me aratī ahu;","snp4.15:4.3":"Athettha sallamaddakkhiṃ,","snp4.15:4.4":"duddasaṃ hadayanissitaṃ. 945.","snp4.15:5.1":"“Yena sallena otiṇṇo,","snp4.15:5.2":"disā sabbā vidhāvati;","snp4.15:5.3":"Tameva sallamabbuyha,","snp4.15:5.4":"na dhāvati na sīdati. 946.","snp4.15:6.1":"“Tattha sikkhānugīyanti [sikkhānukiriyanti (ka.)],","snp4.15:6.2":"yāni loke gadhitāni;","snp4.15:6.3":"Na tesu pasuto siyā,","snp4.15:6.4":"nibbijjha sabbaso kāme;","snp4.15:6.5":"Sikkhe nibbānamattano. 947.","snp4.15:7.1":"“Sacco siyā appagabbho,","snp4.15:7.2":"amāyo rittapesuṇo;","snp4.15:7.3":"Akkodhano lobhapāpaṃ,","snp4.15:7.4":"vevicchaṃ vitare muni. 948.","snp4.15:8.1":"“Niddaṃ tandiṃ sahe thīnaṃ,","snp4.15:8.2":"pamādena na saṃvase;","snp4.15:8.3":"Atimāne na tiṭṭheyya,","snp4.15:8.4":"nibbānamanaso naro. 949.","snp4.15:9.1":"“Mosavajje na nīyetha,","snp4.15:9.2":"rūpe snehaṃ na kubbaye;","snp4.15:9.3":"Mānañca parijāneyya,","snp4.15:9.4":"sāhasā virato care. 950.","snp4.15:10.1":"“Purāṇaṃ nābhinandeyya,","snp4.15:10.2":"nave khantiṃ na kubbaye;","snp4.15:10.3":"Hiyyamāne na soceyya,","snp4.15:10.4":"ākāsaṃ na sito siyā. 951.","snp4.15:11.1":"“Gedhaṃ brūmi mahoghoti,","snp4.15:11.2":"ājavaṃ brūmi jappanaṃ;","snp4.15:11.3":"Ārammaṇaṃ pakappanaṃ,","snp4.15:11.4":"kāmapaṅko duraccayo. 952.","snp4.15:12.1":"“Saccā avokkamma [avokkamaṃ (niddesa)] muni,","snp4.15:12.2":"thale tiṭṭhati brāhmaṇo;","snp4.15:12.3":"Sabbaṃ so [sabbaso (syā. ka.)] paṭinissajja,","snp4.15:12.4":"sa ve santoti vuccati. 953.","snp4.15:13.1":"“Sa ve vidvā sa vedagū,","snp4.15:13.2":"ñatvā dhammaṃ anissito;","snp4.15:13.3":"Sammā so loke iriyāno,","snp4.15:13.4":"na pihetīdha kassaci. 954.","snp4.15:14.1":"“Yodha kāme accatari,","snp4.15:14.2":"saṅgaṃ loke duraccayaṃ;","snp4.15:14.3":"Na so socati nājjheti,","snp4.15:14.4":"chinnasoto abandhano. 955.","snp4.15:15.1":"“Yaṃ pubbe taṃ visosehi,","snp4.15:15.2":"pacchā te māhu kiñcanaṃ;","snp4.15:15.3":"Majjhe ce no gahessasi,","snp4.15:15.4":"upasanto carissasi. 956.","snp4.15:16.1":"“Sabbaso nāmarūpasmiṃ,","snp4.15:16.2":"yassa natthi mamāyitaṃ;","snp4.15:16.3":"Asatā ca na socati,","snp4.15:16.4":"sa ve loke na jīyati. 957.","snp4.15:17.1":"“Yassa natthi idaṃ meti,","snp4.15:17.2":"paresaṃ vāpi kiñcanaṃ;","snp4.15:17.3":"Mamattaṃ so asaṃvindaṃ,","snp4.15:17.4":"natthi meti na socati. 958.","snp4.15:18.1":"“Aniṭṭhurī ananugiddho,","snp4.15:18.2":"anejo sabbadhī samo;","snp4.15:18.3":"Tamānisaṃsaṃ pabrūmi,","snp4.15:18.4":"pucchito avikampinaṃ. 959.","snp4.15:19.1":"“Anejassa vijānato,","snp4.15:19.2":"natthi kāci nisaṅkhati [nisaṅkhiti (sī. pī.)].","snp4.15:19.3":"Virato so viyārabbhā,","snp4.15:19.4":"khemaṃ passati sabbadhi. 960.","snp4.15:20.1":"“Na samesu na omesu,","snp4.15:20.2":"na ussesu vadate muni;","snp4.15:20.3":"Santo so vītamaccharo,","snp4.15:20.4":"nādeti na nirassatī”ti.","snp4.15:20.5":"Attadaṇḍasuttaṃ pannarasamaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. 16."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Pj-ii","bookName":"Suttanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0505a.att","from":2434,"to":2441,"paras":[{"para":2434,"vripara":"950-951","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["<b>Sāhasā</b>ti rattassa rāgacariyādibhedā sāhasakaraṇā.","<b>Purāṇaṃ nābhinandeyyā</b>ti atītarūpādiṃ nābhinandeyya.","<b>Nave</b>ti paccuppanne.","<b>Hiyyamāne</b>ti vinassamāne.","<b>Ākāsaṃ na sito siyā</b>ti taṇhānissito na bhaveyya.","Taṇhā hi rūpādīnaṃ ākāsanato “ākāso”ti vuccati. 952."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2435,"vripara":"952","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["“Kiṃkāraṇā ākāsaṃ na sito siyā”ti ce –","“<b>gedhaṃ brūmī</b>”ti gāthā.","Tassattho – ahañhi imaṃ ākāsasaṅkhātaṃ taṇhaṃ rūpādīsu gijjhanato <b>gedhaṃ brūmi</b> “gedho”ti vadāmi.","Kiñca bhiyyo – avahananaṭṭhena <b>“ogho”</b>ti ca ājavanaṭṭhena <b>“ājava”</b>nti ca “idaṃ mayhaṃ, idaṃ mayha”nti jappakāraṇato <b>“jappana”</b>nti ca dummuñcanaṭṭhena <b>“ārammaṇa”</b>nti ca kampakaraṇena <b>“pakampana”</b>nti ca brūmi, esā ca lokassa palibodhaṭṭhena duratikkamanīyaṭṭhena ca <b>kāmapaṅko duraccayo</b>ti.","“Ākāsaṃ na sito siyā”ti evaṃ vutte vā “kimetaṃ ākāsa”nti ce?","<b>Gedhaṃ brūmī</b>ti.","Evampi tassā gāthāya sambandho veditabbo.","Tattha padayojanā – ākāsanti gedhaṃ brūmīti.","Tathā yvāyaṃ mahoghoti vuccati.","Taṃ brūmi, ājavaṃ brūmi, jappanaṃ brūmi, pakampanaṃ brūmi, yvāyaṃ sadevake loke kāmapaṅko duraccayo, taṃ brūmīti. 953."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2436,"vripara":"953","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["Evametaṃ gedhādipariyāyaṃ ākāsaṃ anissito – <b>saccā avokkammā</b>ti gāthā.","Tassattho – pubbe vuttā tividhāpi <b>saccā avokkamma</b> moneyyappattiyā <b>munī</b>ti saṅkhyaṃ gato nibbānatthale <b>tiṭṭhati brāhmaṇo,</b> sa ve evarūpo sabbāni āyatanāni nissajjitvā <b>“santo”</b>ti vuccatīti. 954."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2437,"vripara":"954","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["Kiñca bhiyyo – <b>sa ve vidvā</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>ñatvā dhamma</b>nti aniccādinayena saṅkhatadhammaṃ ñatvā.","<b>Sammā so loke iriyāno</b>ti asammāiriyanakarānaṃ kilesānaṃ pahānā sammā so loke iriyamāno. 955."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2438,"vripara":"955","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["Evaṃ apihento ca – <b>yodha kāme</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>saṅga</b>nti sattavidhaṃ saṅgañca yo accatari <b>nājjhetī</b>ti nābhijjhāyati. 956."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2439,"vripara":"956","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["Tasmā tumhesupi yo evarūpo hotumicchati, taṃ vadāmi – <b>yaṃ pubbe</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>yaṃ pubbe</b>ti atīte saṅkhāre ārabbha uppajjanadhammaṃ kilesajātaṃ atītakammañca.","<b>Pacchā te māhu kiñcana</b>nti anāgatepi saṅkhāre ārabbha uppajjanadhammaṃ rāgādikiñcanaṃ māhu.","<b>Majjhe ce no gahessasī</b>ti paccuppanne rūpādidhammepi na gahessasi ce. 957."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2440,"vripara":"957","refs":["snp4.15:10"],"lines":["Evaṃ “upasanto carissasī”ti arahattappattiṃ dassetvā idāni arahato thutivasena ito parā gāthāyo abhāsi.","Tattha <b>sabbaso</b>ti gāthāya <b>mamāyita</b>nti mamattakaraṇaṃ, “mama ida”nti gahitaṃ vā vatthu.","<b>Asatā ca na socatī</b>ti avijjamānakāraṇā asantakāraṇā na socati.","<b>Na jīyatī</b>ti jānimpi na gacchati. 958-9."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"]]},{"para":2441,"vripara":"958-959","refs":["snp4.15:10","snp4.15:18"],"lines":["Kiñca bhiyyo – <b>yassa natthī</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>kiñcana</b>nti kiñci rūpādidhammajātaṃ.","Kiñca bhiyyo – <b>aniṭṭhurī</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>aniṭṭhurī</b>ti anissukī.","“Aniddhurī”tipi keci paṭhanti.","<b>Sabbadhī samo</b>ti sabbattha samo, upekkhakoti adhippāyo.","Kiṃ vuttaṃ hoti?","Yo so “natthi me”ti na socati, tamahaṃ avikampinaṃ puggalaṃ puṭṭho samāno aniṭṭhurī ananugiddho anejo sabbadhi samoti imaṃ tasmiṃ puggale catubbidhamānisaṃsaṃ brūmīti. 960."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:10"],["snp4.15:18"],["snp4.15:18"],["snp4.15:18"],["snp4.15:18"],["snp4.15:18"],["snp4.15:18"]]}],"wordLinks":[["snp4.15:10.1","purāṇaṃ nābhinandeyyā",0,1],["snp4.15:10.1","nave",0,2],["snp4.15:10.3","hiyyamāne",0,3],["snp4.15:10.3","ākāsaṃ na sito siyā",0,4],["snp4.15:18.1","aniṭṭhurī",7,2],["snp4.15:18.1","aniṭṭhurī",7,3],["snp4.15:18.1","sabbadhī samo",7,5]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
